"quantum-computing/grovers-algorithm/extracted-"
"outputs/852b1b8c-688f-4d55-bcf3-91cfd7ef02c5-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Saída da célula de código anterior](/learning/images/courses/utility-"
